### Gmail OAuth (requires a login token and configured Google OAuth variables)
GET http://localhost:7000/api/gmail/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Returns the Google consent URL; open data.authUrl in a browser
GET http://localhost:7000/api/gmail/auth
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Explicit Gmail sync
POST http://localhost:7000/api/gmail/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
### Import jobs from Adzuna (replace token with a login token)
POST http://localhost:7000/api/jobs/import/adzuna
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "what": "React Developer",
  "where": "Hyderabad",
  "page": 1,
  "resultsPerPage": 10
}

###
curl -X POST http://localhost:7000/api/jobs
-H "Content-Type: application/json"
-d '{
  "title": "Frontend Developer",
  "company": "Microsoft",
  "location": "Hyderabad",
  "description": "Build modern web applications using React and TypeScript.",
  "skills": [
    "React",
    "JavaScript",
    "TypeScript",
    "Node.js"
  ],
  "experience": "2-4 years",
  "salary": "₹10-18 LPA",
